Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.81,0:00:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now explain the parameters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of the final mission: Operation Skuld.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Modify the result without changing established history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The past consists of Makise Kurisu, lying in a pool of blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and Okabe Rintaro seeing her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the past without changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, pass me that screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you calling me "Dad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, we only get one more chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough fuel for more than one trip to the past and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you won't be able to return to the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I never planned to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,By changing the worldline here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and thereby changing the future, I won't need to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:01:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fail to change it, I'll have to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll probably regret it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.39,0:01:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am the man who will destroy the ruling structure of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now commence Operation Skuld.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is now!
