Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He made me laugh when he said, "The time is now,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and then had to run to the lab because he forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave the time machine there for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cyalume Saber?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The sticky red fluid in its core is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I didn't know that was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You plan to substitute it for Makise Kurisu's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,On July 28th, if I see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,an unconscious Christina lying in a pool of blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the past won't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the idea behind Operation Skuld.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it makes sense, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it seem a little too easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Future Okarin made it sound like a greater force was at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin Kyouma speaks even more dramatically
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,when a plan is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through his schemes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know whether to be impressed or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad scientist delusions again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that Kurisu person sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd get really excited and talk to Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mayushii wouldn't really understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but they were having lots of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two fought all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but really, you were good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu is a scientific genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She would never come to a lab like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she possesses the Reading Steiner too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But somewhere inside, she remembers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened in the other worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone does, somewhere in their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu did everything she could to save Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri... No, all of us can be here now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,because of Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin? Do you like Kurisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina is my assistant, my dear friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and very special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's in love with me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Okarin gets a real girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you have to save her,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to bring her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, um... Miss Amane...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're really my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,who was my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll keep that a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We've managed to arrive at exactly the same time as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the Cyalume Saber where I asked you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Modify the result without changing the established past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For that to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this is where I begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know the overall effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but if I get the metal Upa here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it diminishes the odds of any metal ending up in that folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't many left of this series,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mayushii's out of 100-yen coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act so spoiled, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I've known you since we were kids, I'm not lending you any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how harsh life can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an Upa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it rare?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not rare, but isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, next...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we met somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.05,0:08:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Nakabachi's press conference
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,will now begin in the eighth floor hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never imagined I'd have to pretend to be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kurisu picked up the Upa that Mayuri dropped?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:44.44,Mayushii,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frx6\fry352\pos(1282.5,916.5)\frz331.554}Mayushii
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:44.56,Mayushii,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz331.554\frx10\fry348\pos(1284,741)}Mayushii
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:44.69,Mayushii,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz331.554\frx14\fry350\pos(1300.5,589.5)}Mayushii
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.73,Mayushii,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz330.753\pos(1309.5,510)\frx20\fry350}Mayushii
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But since it isn't metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that paper will burn in the plane accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All that's left is dealing with Nakabachi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and finding a chance to knock out Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The liquid dried up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't used it for such a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that air got inside and dried out the liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Daddy, I wanted you to read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Think...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There has to be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Getting rid of Nakabachi won't be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the blood will be problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If there was just something I could substitute...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you call it stealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A man who yearns for chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One who will destroy the ruling structure of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and the man who will send your ambitions to oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're that kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked together to sabotage my press conference...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:11:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring that knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do my godlike powers strike fear in your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. You're shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan on insulting me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you're just a small, pathetic man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A man too petty to appreciate his own daughter's talent can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's what you get...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Almost there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie down. I'll call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this emergency services?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I need someone here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is, without a doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Kurisu I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you wait just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.23,0:16:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're about to begin the longest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}most important three weeks of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You went too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It all went just as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can do is stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get back, you'll need to go to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll be hard, but try to hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Steins Gate worldline is completely unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But if your theory is correct, the paper will burn, so the time machine arms race won't come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither will World War III.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll say thank you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,850)}I'll see you in seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.60,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.125\pos(934.5,105)\frz1.766}Okabe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.60,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.125\pos(936,276)\frz1.766}Rintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That paper would've completely changed mankind's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a paper for the creation of a time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's gone... Burnt up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,His words were unclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Russian government has denied everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:22.83,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}yume wo tsunaida toki no yuuwaku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:22.83,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}The tempting moment that connects our dream
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was Okarin here, Luka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:28.84,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}arashi no ato no aozora ga shimiru
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:28.84,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}Permeates the blue skies after the violent storm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When he came by...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This badge identifies you as Lab Mem 006.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:34.97,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}shiawase ni naze kakureteiru no?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:34.97,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}Concealing itself within endless happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When did I become a lab mem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:41.22,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}kanashimi no tane bokura wo tamesu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:41.22,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}The seed of grief cruelly tests us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those memories may rest in your other life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:47.36,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}surechigau yasashisa mote amashi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:47.36,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}Actions and words of kindness that pass us by
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:52.15,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}yoru no yami ni furueteta
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:52.15,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}Shiver out of control in the dark of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get something, Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:59.49,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}toomawari shita michi de kizuita
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:59.49,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}In the midst of a road filled with detours,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.99,0:19:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This badge is for Lab Mem 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:06.79,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}nakusenai  mono ga nanda ka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:06.79,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}I realized what I must protect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.29,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you desire my aid, hold the badge and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"La Yohda Stasella." Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:12.80,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}setsunasa wo koete ima yobi au hitomi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:12.80,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}After passing through the suffering, our eyes call out to each other
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe was just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:18.93,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}unmei ga mitsuketa kizuna
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:18.93,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}This is a bond founded by fate itself
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be working here as a part-timer, from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:25.10,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}koware sou na mono afureteru sekai de
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:25.10,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}In a world full of things that are breaking apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kiryu Moeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She helped Nae after she fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:31.36,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}eien to yobitai kimi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:31.36,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}Our meeting is the only event that will last forever
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she didn't have a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so she'll be working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Shiina Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:36.49,True End Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}deaeta koto dake wa
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:36.49,True End,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(100,200)}Flickering tears and twinkling stars
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe started hitting on her the minute he saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Visit the lab whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back-arin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just combine "Welcome back" and "Okarin"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was going shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,These?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He said they're lab mem badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab Mem 002 and 003!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When did we get so many lab mems?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He said they go up to 008.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin's "O."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina, Hashida, Urushibara, Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are "M," "K," and "A"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He had another one that he put in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lab Mem 008 will arrive in seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}More delusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's an inevitable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your inevitable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.73,0:20:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven years...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think it'll be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:21:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven years? I can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think the lab will change,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how many years go by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you writing a paper for an American research lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you working all night on some experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You may still be thinking of your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't remember the three weeks we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now, you're breathing, speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and thinking your hardest about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're observing the same world I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this world with an unknown future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was searching for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.13,0:22:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I protected her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.17,0:22:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flattering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's its choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy Kongroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.47,0:22:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again, Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not Christina, and I'm {\i1}not{\i0} your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome my assistant, Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.33,0:23:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one knows what the future holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.59,0:23:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It has infinite potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}proven by this encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,622)}This is surely the choice of Steins Gate.
